async function changePage(kind){const tab=activeTab;if(!tab||tab.risk||operationBusy||pendingSave)return;const selected=kind==='remove'?[...(tab.selectedPages||new Set([current]))].sort((a,b)=>a-b):[current];if(kind==='remove'&&selected.length>=doc.numPages){status('至少保留一页');return}if(kind==='up'&&current<=1||kind==='down'&&current>=doc.numPages)return;if(!await confirmAction(kind==='remove'?'删除选中的 '+selected.length+' 页？':'修改当前页面？','完成后可撤销，请保存或另存副本。复杂批注或书签可能受到影响。',kind==='remove'?'删除页面':'继续'))return;operationBusy=true;updateEditControls();try{const prior=new Uint8Array(tab.bytes||await doc.getData());if(!tab.savedBytes)tab.savedBytes=prior;const pdf=await PDFLib.PDFDocument.load(prior,{updateMetadata:false});if(pdf.getForm().getFields().length)throw Error('检测到表单，暂不支持编辑');let target=current;if(kind==='rotate'){const page=pdf.getPage(current-1);page.setRotation(PDFLib.degrees((page.getRotation().angle+90)%360))}else if(kind==='remove'){for(const n of [...selected].reverse())pdf.removePage(n-1);target=Math.min(Math.max(1,current-selected.filter(n=>n<current).length),pdf.getPageCount());tab.selectedPages=new Set([target]);tab.selectionAnchor=target}else{const from=current-1,to=from+(kind==='up'?-1:1),page=pdf.getPage(from);pdf.removePage(from);pdf.insertPage(to,page);target=to+1}const bytes=await pdf.save();if(bytes.length>256*1024*1024)throw Error('编辑结果超过 256 MiB');const old={bytes:prior,page:current,dirty:tab.dirty};await installEditedBytes(tab,bytes,target);tab.history.push(old);tab.dirty=true;updateTabs();status('页面已修改，请保存或另存副本')}catch(e){status('页面操作失败：'+e.message)}finally{operationBusy=false;updateEditControls()}}
